# Arclength agent coordination

Before substantive work in this repo:

1. Read `PROJECT_RULES.md` (BUS-*, SITE-*, GP-*, NAME-*).
2. Tail `docs/plans/AGENT_BUS.jsonl` (last ~30 lines).
3. If touching brand/UI/README, read `docs/PRODUCT_IDENTITY.md`.
4. Append a bus heartbeat/announce when starting or finishing strategic work; update `/home/lugatj/code/agent_presence/arclength-continuation.json`.

Do **not** restyle https://lgallindo.github.io/ with product identity — that site is build notes only.

**COMM-OPEN:** Any open/pending/backlog item in status tables must include what / why-open / done-looks-like. See `PROJECT_RULES.md` COMM-OPEN-* and `.cursor/rules/open-items-explained.mdc`.

Internal artifacts: `PLAN_|ANALYSIS_|REPORT_|SPEC_` + `YYYYMMDDTHHMMSSZ` + `_TOPIC`. CLI rename candidates (`alc`/`arclc`/`arclen`/`arccont`) require bus announce — no silent rename.
